emn.review:
Sir khub bhalo poray. Every topic thoroughly bujhai sir. Question krle rege jaina ekdm i, sir ulta expects questions from students. Real world example diye bujhabe ekdm tmk, oi examples gula note kra must. Sir ja bole tai i note krba. It's important. Sir graph k onk prioritize kre. Sir quiz e mcq and descriptive question rakhe. Main problem ekhnei j sometimes unar question bujhte para ektu tough (emn question 1tai paba, bakishb question dekhei bujhba). But impossible kichuna. Onekei bolbe drop dite, drop diona. Unar kache effort dile A paba. R unar previous sem e kon section e kake kmn A dise eshb analyse kreo labh nai, cause variance onk beshi. A paba ki paba na eta class e bhalo students kmn ache and tmi kmn marks paccho depends on that. And ekhn jdi ashi tmr kmne pora uchit. 1. Sir er class e attention continous rakha lagbe. 2. sir ja bolbe note kra lagbe. 3. bashai giye notes gula bujhba + sir er slides mukhostho( amr onk mukhostho kra lagse bhai, kanna paito sometimes
) krba. 4. Graphs gula bashai ekbar holeo practice krba. 5. Sir mostly slides thekei question kre, pechai na ( main problem hocche ei course e ettoh topic j tmi sometimes golai felba j question er answer ta kmn and exactly konta hbe. kichukkhn mone hbe eita abr arekbar mone hbe arekta. eta ei course er i problem amr ja mone hoise. r tar upor ami otoh bhalo student na so yeahh
) So, slides top priority teh rakhba. 6. Sir er assignment bhalo motoh krba, assignment theke question diye dei sir. Assignment e beshi beshi example use krba jegula sir class e bole. sir er assignment dekhlei bujhba kmn question mid final e krbe. 7. Na bujhe slides mukhostho krle question answer krte pera khaba
 ( ami ekta quiz e emn kre amr prestige dubai diye ashchilam)

